{"id":"en_awakening-no-more-silence","title":"Awakening: No More Silence","titleEn":"Awakening: No More Silence","description":"Abigail Mercer believed she was marrying Ethan Mercer for love, but her pregnancy became a season of relentless cruelty at the hands of his family. She endured their bullying without complaint, hoping to preserve harmony in the household. Once Ethan learned what was happening, he chose to stand with his wife and confront his mother and sister directly. Rather than backing down, the two women intensified their attacks, eventually directing their malice at Abigail's infant daughter. That final provocation shattered her patience, and she resolved to stop absorbing the abuse in silence.","poster":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/awakening-no-more-silence/en_US/4fe59afea2519298/cover.webp","backdrop":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/awakening-no-more-silence/en_US/4fe59afea2519298/cover.webp","kind":"series","year":2025,"genres":["Playing Dumb","Short Drama"],"featured":false,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dlabe/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}],"episodes":[{"id":"ep_awakening-no-more-silence_1","title":"Episode 1","season":1,"number":1,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dlabe/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_awakening-no-more-silence_2","title":"Episode 2","season":1,"number":2,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dlabe/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_awakening-no-more-silence_3","title":"Episode 3","season":1,"number":3,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dlabe/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_awakening-no-more-silence_4","title":"Episode 4","season":1,"number":4,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","